# Waddah monorepo .gitignore
#
# The audio is PDPL-protected child speech from King Abdulaziz University
# Hospital. Git history is permanent — a WAV committed once is committed
# forever, even after you delete it. This file is a compliance control, not
# housekeeping.

# --- Data (PDPL) ---
*.wav
*.mp3
*.flac
# ...but the pre-baked prompt audio IS application content and must ship.
# These are ElevenLabs renderings of fixed Arabic words and sentences — a
# synthetic adult voice reading the lexicon. No child speech, no PDPL concern.
# Without this negation the app deploys silent, because `*.mp3` above would
# quietly exclude all 185 clips from the repo and therefore from the build.
!app/assets/audio/*.mp3
# Leading slash = repo root ONLY. A bare `data/` also matched app/lib/data/,
# which holds word_bank.dart (the 84-word list) — the app would not compile
# after a fresh clone. Verified with `git check-ignore -v`.
/data/
manifest_with_splits.csv
**/child_ids*

# --- Model weights (too large for GitHub, live on the HF Hub) ---
*.pt
*.pth
*.bin
*.safetensors
*.ckpt
checkpoints/

# --- Secrets ---
.env
.env.*
# ...but the templates MUST be committed — they are how a teammate knows which
# keys to set. They contain names only, never values.
!.env.example
!.env.*.example
*token*.json
serviceAccountKey.json

# --- Python ---
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
.venv/
venv/
.ipynb_checkpoints/
.pytest_cache/

# --- Flutter / Dart ---
app/build/
app/.dart_tool/
app/.flutter-plugins
app/.flutter-plugins-dependencies
app/ios/Pods/
app/android/.gradle/
app/android/local.properties
app/**/GeneratedPluginRegistrant.*

# --- Editor / OS ---
.DS_Store
.vscode/settings.json

# --- Tool logs ---
# firebase-debug.log lands in the repo root on any CLI failure and contains
# full request/response bodies, including auth-adjacent metadata.
*.log
firebase-debug.log
.firebase/

# --- Waddah monorepo additions ---
# Therapy service runtime output: TTS cache is regenerable, uploaded_recordings
# is child audio (PDPL). Neither belongs in git.
services/therapy-api/generated_audio/
services/therapy-api/uploaded_recordings/
services/therapy-api/*.mp3

# Local checkpoint directory for running the API against disk (Task 3).
model/
*.onnx

# Windows
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini